DESCRIPTION:Greetings BITS2MBA Community ! \n\nWe are delighted to bring to
  you a panel discussion on Indian MBA as a part of the mentorship program !
  To address all your queries regarding the application process\, preparatio
 n strategies\, profile building and lot more\, we have invited three of our
  very own alumni. \n\nIshaan Sarna - IIM A \nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/is
 haan-sarna \n\nShubham Raje - ISB \nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/shubham-raj
 e-75034a99 \n\nChinmay Gokhale - IIM B \nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/chinma
 ysgokhale \n\nMeeting Link- https://us06web.zoom.us/j/85684442832?pwd=xRKak
 pWuG3O3koibEBsWTGAyd8TzbH.1\n\nSubmit your questions here - https://forms.g
 le/VQpPRFxAs3FrxdMn9 \nLooking forward to your participation !\n\n-::~:~::~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~
