DESCRIPTION:GC.OS ESoC "AI for drug discovery" - interview\n\n\n  *   Pleas
 e let us know of any adjustments you require as soon as possible.\n  *   Th
 e interview is a 35min structured interview on technical and non-technical 
 topics related to the project.\n  *   Please be present in the waiting room
  10min prior to meeting start.\n  *   We advise to use teams to check audio
 \, video\, and screensharing before.\n  *   As previously communicated\, ki
 ndly be prepared for a presentation on some coding you have done. The prese
 ntation should be 5 minutes long\, explain the problems you worked on\, and
  your approach to the entry task.\n\n\nSee here for further information on 
 the application process:\nhttps://github.com/european-summer-of-code/esoc20
 25\n\n_____________________________________________________________________
