DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://lu.ma/e/evt-BL8TJKlg3IyU
 gGS?pk=g-5UxvxKyMW4IGPYi\n\nThe third session of our Evals Paper Club is me
 eting in one week\, Tuesday\, 4/29 1600 UTC (12PM EST). We are reading Sabo
 tage Evaluations for Frontier Models: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.21514.\nHe
 y everyone\,\nWe’re kicking off a bi-weekly Reading Group on Evals in Safet
 y Context this Spring 2025\, and you’re invited!\n\nThis is your chance to 
 dive into the cutting-edge ideas shaping the field.\nWhen: Every other week
 \, 12-1pm EST\nFormat:Give a 20-minute paper presentation during the paper 
 club\n40-minute discussion— share your thoughts and questions\nSpring 2025 
 Theme: Foundations and Critiques—let’s…\n\nHosted by Matthew Broerman\, Al-
 Hussein Saqr & Joshua Landes
