DESCRIPTION:Description: In this talk\, we dive into techniques for acceler
 ating inference in transformer-based models by optimizing their linear laye
 rs. We'll explore the role of quantization in reducing computation and memo
 ry overhead\, and discuss how custom\, hardware-friendly kernels can unlock
  significant speedups.\n\nDr. Hicham Badri is a research scientist speciali
 zing in computer vision and large language models. He holds a PhD from Univ
 ersite de Bordeaux/INRIA. During his doctoral studies\, he focused on devel
 oping efficient optimization methods for machine learning applications\, ea
 rning him the AFRIF best PhD award in 2015.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Goog
 le Meet: https://meet.google.com/wdk-yipf-zjd\nOr dial: (US) +1 678-653-593
