DESCRIPTION:<p>Cohere Labs is proud to host Research Hangouts!</p><p>Theses
  sessions are a great opportunity to hangout with other members of our open
  science community\, connect on research and chat about what is happening i
 n the field of machine learning.</p><p>Join us every two weeks for interest
 ing discussions with other community members and Cohere Labs Staff and to g
 et answers to your research questions. We’re building this with you\, so pl
 ease reach out with ideas\, feedback\, and things you’d like to see in this
  Office Hours!</p><p>PS: If you have something specific to discuss\, reach 
 out beforehand. Otherwise\, just show up and ask questions!</p>\n\n-::~:~::
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:
 ~::-\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/cau-wvao-xhd\nOr dial:
  (US) +1 605-653-3565 PIN: 624818176#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet
 /cau-wvao-xhd?pin=2835995889827&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://s
 upport.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not edit this section
 .\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~::~:~::-
