DESCRIPTION:Bio: Ravi Mangal is a postdoctoral researcher at Carnegie Mello
 n University in the Security and Privacy Institute (CyLab). He graduated wi
 th a PhD in Computer Science from Georgia Institute of Technology in 2020. 
 He is interested in all aspects of designing and applying formal methods fo
 r assuring the correctness and safety of software systems. His current rese
 arch focuses on developing algorithms and methodologies for formally analyz
 ing the safety and trustworthiness of learning-enabled systems. <br><br>Lin
 k to paper: "Closed-loop Analysis of Vision-based Autonomous Systems: A Cas
 e Study" <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.04634">https://arxiv.org/abs/2
 302.04634</a><br><br>Ravi's webpage: <a href="https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/us
 er/rmangal/">https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/rmangal/</a>\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\n
