DESCRIPTION:Explore current research trends using synthetic data for traini
 ng. Discover G-NoCL\, an online continual learning framework based on categ
 ory-only data generation. Additionally\, learn about DISCOBER\, a novel dat
 a sampling method enhancing performance over traditional web-supervised and
  manually annotated approaches. (<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.10853"
 ><u>https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.10853</u></a>)<br><br>Diganta's Bio:  Digant
 a is a UNIQUE Scholar Research MSc at Mila\, Montreal supervised by Prof Ir
 ina Rish within the CERC AAI Lab and is a Visiting Researcher at the Human 
 Sensing Lab at Carnegie Mellon University. He is also the founder of a non-
 profit research organisation called Landskape AI. Previously he has worked 
 as researcher and engineer at firms like Weights &amp\; Biases and Morgan S
 tanley. His current research interests spans topics of constrained learning
  - sparsity\, mixture of experts\, lifelong learning\, generative models\, 
 learning dynamics and code generation. Diganta is also an incoming ELLIS Ph
 D Fellow at the Max Planck Institute in Tübingen. Beyond research\, he is a
 n avid football\, F1 and e-sport follower.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Googl
 e Meet: https://meet.google.com/dhk-skzx-uqi\nOr dial: (US) +1 562-419-2161
  PIN: 511075208#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/dhk-skzx-uqi?pin=874
 9693677858&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/u
 sers/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
