DESCRIPTION:Romain's Bio:  Romain completed his PhD at École des Ponts\, wo
 rking with the IMAGINE team (https://imagine-lab.enpc.fr/) and the French M
 apping Agency\, IGN (https://www.ign.fr/). His research focuses on optimiza
 tion and machine learning for 3D data\, with an emphasis on unsupervised le
 arning\, interpretability\, and real-time applications.\n\nElliot's Bio:   
 Elliot is a third-year PhD student (expected graduation in 09/2024) in the 
 Imagine research group at École des Ponts ParisTech and the Willow team at 
 Inria Paris (https://www.di.ens.fr/willow). His research focuses on machine
  learning and computer vision for remote sensing\, particularly satellite i
 mage time series analysis for tasks such as land use classification and cha
 nge detection.The associated paper for the session is @ https://arxiv.org/a
 bs/2304.09704The associated poster for the session is @ https://romainloise
 au.fr/learnable-earth-parser/poster.pdf\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google M
