DESCRIPTION:Will explore Goldfish\, a vision-language model for long video 
 understanding\, featuring an efficient retrieval mechanism and TVQA-long be
 nchmark evaluation.\n\n\nKirolos is currently a Computer Vision Engineer at
  CreativAI. His research interests lie in computer vision and video analysi
 s\, specifically through the use of Multimodal Large Language Models.Kirolo
 s spent about a year as a research intern at KAUST University.In 2023\, He 
 completed my master’s degree in AI and Data Science at Ottawa University in
  Canada. In 2020\, he earned his bachelor’s degree in Computer Engineering 
 from Shoubra Faculty of Engineering\, Benha University in Egypt.\n\n-::~:~:
