DESCRIPTION:Learn how Texture Matching GAN (TMGAN) enhances precision by de
 noising\, sharpening\, and separating anatomy from texture using a Siamese 
 network\, reducing hallucination risks in AI applications.\n\nMadhuri works
  at Apple as a Camera Algorithms Engineer. She graduated from Purdue Univer
 sity with a PhD. For her PhD research\, she worked with Prof. Bouman to dev
 elop novel and efficient solutions to produce noise-free\, sharper and clin
 ically acceptable reconstructions of medical CT (X-ray computed tomography)
 . Madhuri also collaborated with GE HealthCare to develop a reconstruction 
 algorithm for a radically new technology\, photon counting CT.\n\n-::~:~::~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~
