ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=Steven
  Clarke;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:steven.clarke@microsoft.com
CREATED:20250616T133709Z
DESCRIPTION:Hi\,\n\nThanks for signing up for the session. I’m looking forw
 ard to chatting with you.\n\nAs described in the study screener\, I’d like 
 to spend most of the time during the session watching you work. I will ask 
 you to share your screen with me while you work on a current project. It’s 
 important for the research project that you are able to share a project\, n
 ot something like a tutorial. For this research project we need to observe 
 how you work with AI coding assistants while working on a familiar project.
 \n\nIf this is going to be difficult\, please let me know in advance. I wil
 l not be able to proceed with the study session if you aren’t able to share
  your screen while working on a project.\n\nThanks\,\n\nSteven\n___________
 _____________________________________________________________________\nMicr
 osoft Teams meeting Need help?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-GB>\
 nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/2658259976276?p=AgPL8tQwbbh3eFObuF 
