 ization addresses them. Participants will learn how to optimize various sta
 ges of LLM inference while weighing the trade-offs between speed\, efficien
 cy\, and accuracy.\nThe hands-on portion of the tutorial guides attendees t
 hrough practical examples\, demonstrating how to apply and calibrate differ
