DESCRIPTION:Every two months\, we host experienced researchers who share wi
 th us their visions for promising research ideas or directions in 5 minute 
 pitches. After pitches\, a 1 hour social starts where everyone engages with
  each speaker in a break out room\, to discuss ideas further\, share experi
 ence\, and potentially explore avenues for collaboration.
