DESCRIPTION:In this session\, we'll be discussing Quantization-Aware Traini
 ng (QAT) performance degradation in low precision\, presenting a novel end-
 to-end MXFP4 training algorithm called "Quartet".\n\nAndrei is a PhD studen
 t at ISTA and ELLIS researching novel approaches to efficient LLM training 
 and inference.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
