 re Labs and more.<a href="https://sites.google.com/cohere.com/coherelabs-co
 mmunity/community-programs/summer-school" target="_blank"> Learn more about
  all upcoming speakers in this event series.</a><br><br>This math refresher
  will leave you confident to take on machine learning problems! We will bui
 ld your mathematical foundation and cover the following concepts: calculus\
 , vector calculus\, and linear algebra. Learning these concepts will allow 
 you to understand the math upon which many algorithms are built.\n\n-::~:~:
