DESCRIPTION:<span>Saheed Azeez\, a first class mechanical engineering with 
 experience in building real world machine learning applications suited to N
 igerians.</span><br><br>Saheed recently released YarnGPT\, an open source t
 ext to speech model trained on Nigerian languages and accents. He has won p
 rizes in about 5 major machine learning hackathons in Nigeria. <span>Saheed
 </span><span>  will overview his t</span><span>echnical background\, the id
 ea behind </span><span>YarnGPT</span><span> and how it works\, gathering da
 ta\, building the model.</span>\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
