DESCRIPTION:The Responsible Prompting API is an open-source\, pre-inference
  recommender system to help users craft safer\, clearer\, and more effectiv
 e prompts for large language models. Unlike fine-tuning or post-inference g
 uardrails\, this lightweight tool offers real-time suggestions before infer
 ence\, helping reduce harmful outputs and unnecessary prompt iterations. De
 signed especially for domain experts with little prompting experience\, it 
 supports more responsible AI use without sacrificing user control. At its c
 ore is a growing\, community-driven values database\, and we invite feedbac
 k and collaboration to help shape its future.\n\nAshwath Vaithinathan Aravi
 ndan is a graduate student at the University of Southern California special
 izing in Artificial Intelligence. Currently he is a Research Scientist Inte
 rn at IBM Research\, working as a part of the Responsible Technologies team
  on the Responsible Prompting API - an open-source system for safer and mor
 e effective prompting with LLMs. His background spans research in Responsib
 le AI\, Generative models\, and Computer Vision models for medical imaging\
 , alongside open-source contributions to projects like Heat and MuseScore. 
 Ashwath is passionate about building AI systems that are both technically r
 obust and socially aligned.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google Meet: https:/
 /meet.google.com/sby-exhe-mod\nOr dial: (US) +1 916-318-8172 PIN: 390843181
 #\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/sby-exhe-mod?pin=3047090639987&hs=7
 \n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/928
 2720\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
LAST-MODIFIED:20250621T215212Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ashwath V A - Responsible Prompting API: Pre-Inference Recommendati
 ons for Effective LLM Interactions
